{"status":"REVIEW","clause_id":"PAY-f97870a04cfea0eea9a7","clause_number":"2.6.2","title":"2.6.2.Ezetimibe：(94/6/1、115/9/1)","source":{"key":"pay","label":"給付規定","status":"REVIEW","error":null,"indexed_nodes":6807,"tables":155,"source_name":"最新版藥品給付規定內容(整份帶走)-115.10.22更新","version":"2026-10-22","announcement_date":null,"page_updated_date":"2026-10-27","effective_date":null,"date_status":"待人工核實，未確認現行有效","verification_status":"REVIEW","pdf_url":"/documents/pay.pdf","pdf_sha256":"5bdd0292a73271c98f7f39afca6971b2bd8fbd4c78a697cd37f43ab78cd1414b"},"pdf_page_start":41,"pdf_page_end":41,"scope":"原始節點及既有子項；非人工驗證完整條文","verification_status":"REVIEW","human_verified":false,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p001526","raw_text":"2.6.2.Ezetimibe：(94/6/1、115/9/1)","display_text":"2.6.2.Ezetimibe：(94/6/1、115/9/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[1069]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p001527","raw_text":"限用於原發性高膽固醇血症、同型接合子家族性高膽固醇血症、同型接合子性麥脂醇血症(植物脂醇血症)患者，並符合下列條件之一者：","display_text":"限用於原發性高膽固醇血症、同型接合子家族性高膽固醇血症、同型接合子性麥脂醇血症(植物脂醇血症)患者，並符合下列條件之一者：","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[1070]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p001528","raw_text":"1.對statins類藥品發生無法耐受藥物不良反應（如Severe myalgia、Myositis）者。(94/6/1、115/9/1)","display_text":"1.對statins類藥品發生無法耐受藥物不良反應（如Severe myalgia、Myositis）者。(94/6/1、115/9/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[1071]"},{"type":"paragraph","paragraph_id":"給付規定-p001529","raw_text":"2.經使用statins類藥品單一治療6-8週未達治療目標者，得合併使用本類藥品與statins類藥品。但下表所列項目，需經使用statins類藥品單一治療3個月未達治療目標者，始得與statins類藥品併用。(115/9/1)","display_text":"2.經使用statins類藥品單一治療6-8週未達治療目標者，得合併使用本類藥品與statins類藥品。但下表所列項目，需經使用statins類藥品單一治療3個月未達治療目標者，始得與statins類藥品併用。(115/9/1)","numbering":null,"source_xpath":"/w:document/w:body/w:p[1072]"},{"type":"table","table":{"table_id":"給付規定-table-0005","source_format":"docx","source_file":"01_健保給付規定/originals/2026-10-22/完整給付規定1151022.docx","source_file_hash":"8a55de34fa0e2a0903ed